diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 041b380..6f19fc7 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,5 +1,10 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## 2.0.1
+
+Changed
+- `badge.dietary.font-size` and `badge.counter.font-size`: `font.size.2xs` (11px) → `font.size.xs` (12px), as defined in Figma
+
 ## 2.0.0
 
 Design system rebuilt from the Figma file. Breaking for consumers: class and variable names change, rendered values don't (site migration verified pixel-identical).
diff --git a/dist/tokens.css b/dist/tokens.css
index f3e6f41..a5f8980 100644
--- a/dist/tokens.css
+++ b/dist/tokens.css
@@ -330,9 +330,9 @@
